    "en": "|cffffcc00MISSION FAILED|r"
  },
  "ToD_A02_M06_MESS_017": {
    "hash": "da12cf1e9e",
    "en": "|cff32cd32HINT|r\nThe Tome of War increased combat mastery of your units. Now they have level 1 of attack and defend upgrades."
  },
